794
00:33:29.428 --> 00:33:30.261
(Joanne laughs)
A day job?

795
00:33:30.261 --> 00:33:32.610
Like, do you understand what is entailed

796
00:33:32.610 --> 00:33:34.030
in being a partner in a law firm?

797
00:33:34.030 --> 00:33:35.240
You've got like,

798
00:33:35.240 --> 00:33:38.510
