00:34:06.150 --> 00:34:08.180
And you're like running marathons

810
00:34:08.180 --> 00:34:09.770
and doing all this other stuff.

811
00:34:09.770 --> 00:34:11.360
I feel like I have a busy life.

812
00:34:11.360 --> 00:34:13.280
I can't imagine.

813
00:34:13.280 --> 00:34:14.980
My life can get a little hectic.

814
00:34:16.075 --> 00:34:18.420
But, you know, 16, 17 years

815
00:34:18.420 --> 00:34:20.500
of, you know, writing down your time,

816
00:34:20.500 --> 00:34:22.180
putting time entries in,

