1367
00:56:57.160 --> 00:56:59.840
Like, he's like, "Richie move fours to threes."

1368
00:56:59.840 --> 00:57:00.910
And I was like, "I'll take that."

1369
00:57:00.910 --> 00:57:01.743
You know?
Exactly.

1370
00:57:01.743 --> 00:57:04.650
I think you're moving fours to twos though.

1371
00:57:04.650 --> 00:57:06.140
Or maybe fours to one.

1372
00:57:06.140 --> 00:57:07.070
'Cause I don't know.
That's very flattering,

1373
00:57:07.070 --> 00:57:08.850
but I'll settle for three, two.

1374
00:57:08.850 --> 00:57:11.510
I think that's monumental.

1375
00:57:11.510 --> 00:57:15.380
I love that one story that you've told about,

1376
00:57:15.380 --> 00:57:19.500
