1395
00:58:06.020 --> 00:58:09.230
And that was so powerful to me.

1396
00:58:09.230 --> 00:58:10.120
Now, she didn't say,

1397
00:58:10.120 --> 00:58:12.250
and next I'm going to vote for Joe Biden

1398
00:58:12.250 --> 00:58:13.330
or anything like that.

1399
00:58:13.330 --> 00:58:14.980
She wasn't saying any of those things,

1400
00:58:14.980 --> 00:58:16.500
but she didn't need to.

1401
00:58:16.500 --> 00:58:21.000
The fact that she felt comfortable enough

1402
00:58:21.000 --> 00:58:23.860
