1404
00:58:27.080 --> 00:58:30.930
And there's so much that can be built upon that connection

1405
00:58:30.930 --> 00:58:33.190
with time with patients and with compassion.

1406
00:58:33.190 --> 00:58:34.870
Mm-hmm. Yeah.

1407
00:58:34.870 --> 00:58:37.850
And in the stories that you tell, it's not just,

1408
00:58:37.850 --> 00:58:41.010
I mean, the kind of Korean diaspora

