00:58:41.010 --> 00:58:42.460
and the immigrant experience

1410
00:58:42.460 --> 00:58:44.170
and your own personal relationship

1411
00:58:44.170 --> 00:58:46.400
with your parents and your grandparents,

1412
00:58:46.400 --> 00:58:48.900
is a huge part of what you do.

1413
00:58:48.900 --> 00:58:51.800
But it's also, as you just mentioned,

1414
00:58:51.800 --> 00:58:53.460
your struggles with disordered eating,

1415
00:58:53.460 --> 00:58:56.500
your struggles with mental health and self harm,

1416
00:58:56.500 --> 00:58:57.450
your divorce,

1417
00:58:57.450 --> 00:59:00.400
you know, emerging out of an abusive relationship,

1418
00:59:00.400 --> 00:59:04.223
you know, how do you, deal with boundaries.

1419
00:59:05.205 --> 00:59:10.020
I mean, it's really this primer on self-help

1420
00:59:10.020 --> 00:59:12.290
