01:01:35.613 --> 01:01:37.800
And you doing all of this yourself?

1490
01:01:37.800 --> 01:01:40.780
Yes, it is currently a one-woman show.

1491
01:01:40.780 --> 01:01:42.222
It is very, I don't think that's sustainable. (laughs)

1492
01:01:42.222 --> 01:01:44.055
That's very intense.

1493
01:01:45.110 --> 01:01:48.870
I have sustainability concerns about this whole thing.

1494
01:01:48.870 --> 01:01:51.150
I'm gonna get into that a little bit more in a minute.

1495
01:01:51.150 --> 01:01:53.970
But, (coughs) excuse me.

1496
01:01:53.970 --> 01:01:55.530
Mm-hmm.

1497
01:01:55.530 --> 01:01:59.380
I think that, I'm sure a lot of people say to you,

1498
01:01:59.380 --> 01:02:00.530
like, "Why TikTok?

1499
01:02:00.530 --> 01:02:01.430
Like isn't, TikTok

