01:02:04.630 --> 01:02:07.820
My sense of one of the reasons

1502
01:02:07.820 --> 01:02:09.730
why this has been so successful on TikTok,

1503
01:02:09.730 --> 01:02:11.383
I mean, you could have just been putting these up

1504
01:02:11.383 --> 01:02:14.240
on Instagram or YouTube-
Mm-hmm.

1505
01:02:14.240 --> 01:02:16.470
And I'm sure they would have been very successful.

1506
01:02:16.470 --> 01:02:18.410
But there is a timing aspect of this,

1507
01:02:18.410 --> 01:02:21.900
in that, TikTok was reaching an inflection point.

1508
01:02:21.900 --> 01:02:25.320
It's traditionally populated by much younger people.

1509
01:02:25.320 --> 01:02:28.880
It is, you know, associated with kids dancing

1510
01:02:28.880 --> 01:02:30.150
and, you know, the hype house

1511
01:02:30.150 --> 01:02:33.100
or whatever all that kind of craziness is,

1512
01:02:33.100 --> 01:02:37.300
but it felt like a moment in which it was ready

1513
01:02:37.300 --> 01:02:40.490
for the next iteration of what's possible.

1514
01:02:40.490 --> 01:02:41.323
Mm-hmm.

1515
01:02:41.323 --> 01:02:45.550
At a time when there was so much onboarding going on

1516
01:02:45.550 --> 01:02:48.540
and an algorithm that is really excellent

1517
01:02:48.540 --> 01:02:51.360
at delivering to people what they want.

1518
01:02:51.360 --> 01:02:54.280
So if you're getting a little bit of attention,

1519
01:02:54.280 --> 01:02:57.510
that algorithm knows how to feed that up to a lot of people.

1520
01:02:57.510 --> 01:03:02.200
So with that, and with you coming to the platform

1521
01:03:02.200 --> 01:03:03.930
and really delivering on a level

1522
01:03:03.930 --> 01:03:05.640
