1524
01:03:09.120 --> 01:03:11.990
that led to, you know, this astronomical,

1525
01:03:11.990 --> 01:03:14.560
like rise that you experienced.

1526
01:03:14.560 --> 01:03:16.910
I definitely think timing had a lot to do with it,

1527
01:03:16.910 --> 01:03:19.760
not just for TikTok, but for me personally as well.

1528
01:03:19.760 --> 01:03:20.700
I was going through

1529
01:03:20.700 --> 01:03:23.160
