1801
01:14:08.520 --> 01:14:13.520
I think flavor is a good place to start with any cuisine.

1802
01:14:14.730 --> 01:14:17.830
And that's certainly the case with Korean cuisine.

1803
01:14:17.830 --> 01:14:22.200
Think less about proteins or the produce,

1804
01:14:22.200 --> 01:14:24.460
