2874
02:00:01.740 --> 02:00:06.740
Like you can't show up in your full capacity to give,

2875
02:00:08.226 --> 02:00:11.060
something is gonna crack in the meantime, right?

2876
02:00:11.060 --> 02:00:12.450
So where is this headed?

2877
02:00:12.450 --> 02:00:15.300
Like, how are you thinking about what the next year

2878
02:00:15.300 --> 02:00:16.580
or two looks like?

2879
02:00:16.580 --> 02:00:20.790
So right now I can tell you what it is right now.

2880
02:00:20.790 --> 02:00:24.750
And also a little bit of kind of where I see things headed.

2881
02:00:24.750 --> 02:00:27.090
Right now, I'm a lawyer.

2882
02:00:27.090 --> 02:00:30.270
My clients get 100% of me.

2883
02:00:30.270 --> 02:00:33.600
There is no ever like, "Oh, well, you know,

2884
02:00:33.600 --> 02:00:35.540
maybe I can move this deposition

2885
