so I could do this TikTok," that does not happen.

2886
02:00:39.020 --> 02:00:42.000
And what that means is that sometimes people on TikTok

2887
02:00:42.000 --> 02:00:43.490
don't see me for a bit, you know,

2888
02:00:43.490 --> 02:00:46.510
'cause I just, as you probably know,

2889
02:00:46.510 --> 02:00:48.520
I mean, if you're in trial mode,

2890
02:00:48.520 --> 02:00:51.990
you can't possibly do anything else, you can barely eat.

2891
02:00:51.990 --> 02:00:54.840
And so that will continue to happen

2892
02:00:54.840 --> 02:00:56.400
for as long as I am an attorney,

2893
02:00:56.400 --> 02:01:00.800
'cause I'm never going to allow my clients to suffer

2894
02:01:00.800 --> 02:01:02.740
because of The Korean Vegan.

2895
02:01:02.740 --> 02:01:05.020
And that I think, is the ethical and right thing to do.

2896
02:01:05.020 --> 02:01:07.700
And it's, you know, the honest thing to do.

2897
02:01:07.700 --> 02:01:11.527
That said, you know, one of my closest friends said to me,

2898
02:01:11.527 --> 02:01:14.800
"Look, Joanne, I'm sure you're a fantastic lawyer.

2899
02:01:14.800 --> 02:01:16.510
I'm sure you're really good at your job

2900
02:01:16.510 --> 02:01:18.830
