2901
02:01:18.830 --> 02:01:21.860
But I gotta believe, no offense,

2902
02:01:21.860 --> 02:01:24.330
that there's somebody who can do what you can do

2903
02:01:24.330 --> 02:01:26.890
as a lawyer, but there's literally nobody

2904
02:01:26.890 --> 02:01:28.610
