2907
02:01:34.220 --> 02:01:36.110
And she said that to me around the time

2908
02:01:36.110 --> 02:01:37.647
I listened to that David Epstein podcast.

2909
02:01:37.647 --> 02:01:40.940
So it was like all sort like kind of converging.

2910
02:01:40.940 --> 02:01:44.580
And so that absolutely resonated with me.

2911
02:01:44.580 --> 02:01:47.580
And I think a lot now about, you know,

2912
02:01:47.580 --> 02:01:50.050
what is the purpose of The Korean Vegan?

2913
02:01:50.050 --> 02:01:53.780
And it really is as high faluting

2914
02:01:53.780 --> 02:01:58.520
