2915
02:01:58.520 --> 02:02:00.770
I mean, it sounds very trite

2916
02:02:00.770 --> 02:02:02.300
and (indistinct) in some respects

2917
02:02:02.300 --> 02:02:04.930
but it's also simply beautiful.

2918
02:02:04.930 --> 02:02:08.860
I want to leave this place more wonderful than it was

2919
02:02:08.860 --> 02:02:10.310
