2930
02:02:38.844 --> 02:02:39.800
And you don't need to know.

2931
02:02:39.800 --> 02:02:41.660
You know, and I think the conservative approach,

2932
02:02:41.660 --> 02:02:44.290
and this is something that I struggled with when I was

2933
02:02:44.290 --> 02:02:48.190
contemplating walking away from the law is this, you know,

2934
02:02:48.190 --> 02:02:53.190
very attorney oriented perspective of, you know,

2935
02:02:53.260 --> 02:02:54.590
don't be irresponsible.

2936
02:02:54.590 --> 02:02:56.460
I got one foot in the law thing and yeah,

2937
02:02:56.460 --> 02:02:58.060
I got my other foot in this other thing

2938
02:02:58.060 --> 02:03:00.360
and let's just be safe.

2939
02:03:00.360 --> 02:03:02.350
We'll see how this other thing pans out.

2940
02:03:02.350 --> 02:03:03.850
And then we can decide.

2941
02:03:03.850 --> 02:03:08.850
But back to the mystical, you are putting a stop gap

2942
02:03:10.230 --> 02:03:12.150
