2943
02:03:12.150 --> 02:03:14.070
as long as you're straddling both worlds.

2944
02:03:14.070 --> 02:03:16.970
And on some level you have to let go of the fear

2945
02:03:16.970 --> 02:03:18.710
and like take the leap.

2946
02:03:18.710 --> 02:03:22.020
And that provides the opening for the thing to come in.

2947
02:03:22.020 --> 02:03:26.150
And when I look at what you're doing and the future that

2948
02:03:28.014 --> 02:03:31.180
