2949
02:03:31.180 --> 02:03:33.880
Like you have so much going on and there's so much more

2950
02:03:33.880 --> 02:03:36.000
that I think that you can give.

2951
02:03:36.000 --> 02:03:37.490
And I would just like to see you

2952
02:03:37.490 --> 02:03:39.820
