2956
02:03:46.540 --> 02:03:48.410
I mean, it's already a better place with everything

2957
02:03:48.410 --> 02:03:49.600
that you're doing,

2958
02:03:49.600 --> 02:03:54.600
but I'm excited about what you're capable of producing

2959
02:03:54.640 --> 02:03:58.390
